version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/computational-chemical-engineering/ammonia_synthesis_reactor"
keywords:
  - ammonia synthesis
  - membrane reactor
  - packed bed reactor
  - concentration polarization
  - Sherwood correlation
  - reactor modelling
abstract: >-
  A two-dimensional axisymmetric, non-isothermal model of a packed bed
  membrane reactor for ammonia synthesis over a Ru/C catalyst, together
  with the one-dimensional models it is compared against and the cached
  pipeline that regenerates every figure and the archived dataset of the
  accompanying paper. The package includes a fitted Sherwood correction
  and a mechanistic, reaction-screened closure for the concentration
  polarization at the membrane wall.
